    "sub_name": "軟體工程開發實務",
    "sub_ename": "SOFTWARE ENGINEERING PRACTICES",
    "describe_ch": "介紹軟體工程基本的原則與觀念。學生修習此課後可以學習到軟體工程紀律、專案管理、需求、設計、測試、版本管理及軟體維護等基本觀念。學生可以透過操作軟體工程工具的方式學習這些概念。",
    "describe_eh": "Introduce the basic principles and concepts of software engineering. Upon completing this course, students will have a basic understanding of software engineering disciplines, project management, requirements, software design, testing, version control, and software maintenance. Students will learn the concept by means of software engineering tools.",
